"2024-12-11T20:17:03Z","updated_at":"2024-12-11T20:17:03Z","body":"> Am facing this issue currently, how can one resolve it `Scoped command binaries/main not found`\r\n\r\ndid you solve this? if yes, how?","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/2537028167/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"valentimcanejo","id":42099466,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDk5NDY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42099466?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo","html_url":"https://github.com/valentimcanejo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/2569566986","html_url":"https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1298#issuecomment-2569566986","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/1298","id":2569566986,"node_id":"IC_kwDOC7lts86ZKHsK","user":{"login":"Stancobridge","id":22870440,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODcwNDQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22870440?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge","html_url":"https://github.com/Stancobridge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-03T17:19:32Z","updated_at":"2025-01-03T17:20:18Z","body":"hi @valentimcanejo, I was able to fix this\r\n\r\nhere is how I was able to solve it.\r\n\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"$schema\": \"../gen/schemas/desktop-schema.json\",\r\n  \"identifier\": \"default\",\r\n  \"description\": \"Capability for the main window\",\r\n  \"windows\": [\"main\"],\r\n  \"permissions\": [\r\n    \"core:path:default\",\r\n    \"core:event:default\",\r\n    \"core:window:default\",\r\n    \"core:app:default\",\r\n    \"core:resources:default\",\r\n    \"core:menu:default\",\r\n    \"core:tray:default\",\r\n    \"store:default\",\r\n    {\r\n      \"identifier\": \"shell:allow-spawn\",\r\n      \"allow\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"name\": \"binaries/main\",\r\n          \"sidecar\": true\r\n        }\r\n      ]\r\n    },\r\n    \"shell:allow-open\"\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nthis file is located in `src-tauri/capabilities/default.json`\r\n\r\nI don't know why this is not mentioned in their documentation.\r\n\r\nhere is how I start the sidecar using spawn which is what I need for my usecase,\r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst command = Command.sidecar(\"binaries/main\");\r\nconst  childProcess = await command.spawn();\r\n```\r\n\r\nif u want to use `execute()` method, replace the `\"shell:allow-spawn\"` with `\"shell:allow-execute\"`","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/comments/2569566986/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"Stancobridge","id":22870440,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyODcwNDQw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22870440?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge","html_url":"https://github.com/Stancobridge","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Stancobridge/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":15809472658,"node_id":"MEE_lADOC7lts84wr7ZvzwAAAAOuUWiS","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tauri-apps/tauri/issues/events/15809472658","actor":{"login":"valentimcanejo","id":42099466,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyMDk5NDY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42099466?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo","html_url":"https://github.com/valentimcanejo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valentimcanejo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/valent